// Dialog :
"P560538330" "They wiped the info? Damn! I was <i>sure</i> we'd get a lead on this one.<br><br>I don't know why they would have wiped their logs, {HeroName}. That's not standard Column procedure. Either Leon took his sweet time reaching the main database, or something leaked.<br><br><color orange>Laura's face twists into a wry smile, and she cocks an eyebrow at you.</color><br><br>It's possible that my arrival in Paragon has drawn more attention than I expected."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - LockhartDoorTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3255244025" "Are you ready to head out, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1986319439" "I'm ready, Laura. (Start Mission)"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P651136299" "Alright, {HeroName}. I've put together a few possible avenues we can pursue in this investigation, and I wanted to get your-<br><br><color orange>Laura stops herself short, putting a hand to her ear. You can hear muffled chatter coming from her earpiece.<br><br></color>Missed that last message, Central, please repeat.<br><br><color orange>As the chatter continues, Laura's eyes grow wide. She looks up at you, her mouth slightly agape.</color><br><br>We're going to have to cut off the planning discussion for now, {HeroName}. I just got a report of a massive Column operation near Royal Overlook, and it sounds like Council forces are mobilizing to meet them.<br><br>This is big, {HeroName}. If we don't nip that fight in the bud, it could spill out into the rest of Steel Canyon."
// AcceptString :
"P307427711" "How should we proceed?"
// SendOffString :
"P2351711434" "We'll get you and Leon transport to the area. I know you could probably get there yourself, but we'll need to coordinate our efforts if we want to minimize damage.<br><br>Once you arrive at Royal Overlook, I can help direct the two of you. I'll be working with my team at Central, so we should be able to pin down the hotspots and point you to them.<br><br>Let me know as soon as you're ready, {HeroName}. We can't afford to waste any time."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3983673600" "Stop the fighting in Steel Canyon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3116513317" "We don't have a moment to spare, {HeroName}. We need to get this show on the road."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3876517749" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Wars of Old</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P554429221" "You hear the sounds of explosions and automatic weaponry in the distance. Time to move."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3892132772" "Rescue the workers at the Construction Site!"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P2442815618" "Construction Site Skirmish"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P476642170" "Stop the fighting downtown!"
// Script Variable WaypointNames :
"P1361088760" "Downtown Skirmish"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3028652569" "Protect Dupont Tower!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3182278618" "Boss Name"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - BadgeEarned 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P151251881" "You prevented Dupont Tower from collapsing!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2705414618" "<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>Alright. Can the two of you read me?<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>There's a construction zone a few hundred yards east of your position. I'm getting reports of a firefight in the vicinity.<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>Head there first. If that construction site is active, it's a sure bet there will be civilians in the area."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3110761450" "<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>I was afraid of this. Those construction workers won't be able to evacuate safely as long as there's fighting nearby. You're going to need to clear the area first."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1978855367" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>Good work. Let's see... I'm picking up activity near the shops downtown.<t=7 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=7><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>The area's been evacuated already, but if the fighting isn't contained, it could spill out into the rest of Steel Canyon."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1958325392" "<t=6 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>You're going to need to move fast. I'm getting reports of a massive firefight near Dupont Tower.<t=8 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=8><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>That building is old - as in, constructed under pretty liberal fire safety codes. If the fighting keeps up, that whole tower could go up in smoke."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P678365811" "<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>Good work. It looks like both the 5th Column and the Council have ordered their forces to withdraw.<t=5 caption x= 0.5 y=0.4 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>At the very least, we've bought ourselves some time."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2303902622" "<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>My god...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>There... there were still civilians in that tower, {HeroName}. I can't believe...<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>This has to stop. Take down both sides and END their fighting - by any means necessary!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3189382546" "Tch... I'm roughed up pretty bad. Sorry, {HeroName}, but you're going to have to go it alone from here."
// Script Variable Greeting :
"P1127431811" "Hello, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3786581219" "<t 4><t 0>We read you, Lockhart. Go ahead."

