"P432743635" "I don't want you to rush this, {HeroName}, but we can't really afford to delay, either. When you're ready, you'd better head to that outpost."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4235899167" "You can see what Laura was talking about. The 5th Column have barely bothered to fortify this place. It's certainly not being used for any standard operations."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P2460697344" "From what the 5th Column's informant told you, a large-scale assault on the UNSF base may already be underway. They're not equipped to repel an assault force. You'll need to get there quickly, if the local UNSF forces are to have any hope of survival."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1595311812" "Talk to the Officer"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P53632726" "Use the comm terminal"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2531513499" "5th Column Officer"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3923109101" "This is outrageous. The Column should not sit and beg for these scraps! Our strength alone is enough to destroy the Council!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1334670828" "{HeroName}! I shall rid myself of this wretched assignment when I present you to my superiors!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P4181086669" "Ugh... this truly is the worst day of my military career..."
// Script Variable BOSS_DEAD_DIALOG :
"P3057730234" "You... fiend..."
// Script Variable BOSS_KILLEDHERO_DIALOG :
"P3836789332" "Ha! They'll have no choice but to promote me!"

