"P3958440053" "<t 5>Hmph! It appears this exercise has culled more from the herd than I had anticipated.<t 3>No matter. I will handle you myself."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2026748645" "<face marker:BossFace>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4180528433" "<t 4>Ah. {HeroName}.<t 5>Our informant was correct in his assessment of your abilities.<t 5>I was beginning to grow... disappointed in the lackluster defenses in this facility.<t 0>You, however, should prove to be a... valuable exercise."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P121741027" "Most valuable, indeed."
