// EntryString :
"P444648045" "These are the coordinates you recorded after tracing Leon's signal. With any luck, he'll still be here."
// ExitStringSuccess :
"P2545803314" "Without Leon's help, the 5th Column's offensive is doomed. The fighting is sure to die down, and Steel Canyon will no longer remain a battlefield.<br><br>The 5th Column and the Council will likely retreat to their bases and outposts to lick their wounds. They will return, without a doubt, but for now... there is peace."
